    {
     "text": "Stir-fry the pork until browned, add the wombok, carrot, spring onion and ginger and cook until wilted, then season with the soy and sesame oil and cool.",
     "min": 12
    },
    {
     "text": "Lay out a wrapper, add a spoon of filling, fold in the sides and roll up tightly, sealing with a dab of water.",
